   "description": "<p><p> <i>Always Fast, Simple, and Accessible with \"My MCI\" </i></p><p>Welcome to the exciting world of <i>My MCI </i>! This app brings together all the services that MCI(Hamrah-e-Aval) offers to its subscribers. From now on, you no longer need to memorize shortcodes or search for them online. With <i>My MCI </i>, activating services and packages is quick and easy. The latest version of the app not only resolves reported issues and bugs, but it also makes accessing various services more convenient, allowing you to pay bills and top up your balance with ease. In addition, <i>My MCI </i> gives you access to combination packages, special companion packages, and a wide range of communication ser",
